+`0cbdf100dbf84df50c64f792b1f940e3a67859a6` (relux-works/agent-session-manager-spec@v0.6.0).
+Historical scope retained: SPEC v0.5.0 (commit `28bf96d7dd7ebf3cd9e2ccd91d35b8660699dd5c`),
